---
import UseCase from '../../components/UseCase.astro';
---

<UseCase
  source="agencies"
  seoTitle="AI social media tool for agencies and freelancers"
  seoDescription="Run up to three client brands from one AdMobot account: separate Brand Brains, strategies, approvals and publishing for each client. ₹12,999/month for Pro / Agency."
  eyebrow="For agencies & freelancers"
  title="Three clients. One login."
  accent="Zero blank pages."
  intro="Give each client its own Brand Brain, strategy and approval flow. AdMobot drafts, designs and schedules; you review, polish and keep the client relationship. Take on more clients without hiring another writer."
  pains={[
    ['Every client sounds different', 'Switching between five brand voices in a day is where quality slips and generic copy creeps in.'],
    ['Approvals by WhatsApp', 'Screenshots, “final_v3”, and a client who replies at midnight. Posts miss their slot.'],
    ['Reporting eats Fridays', 'Collecting likes and reach from every platform for every client, every month, by hand.'],
  ]}
  capabilities={[
    ['A Brand Brain per client', "Each brand's voice, audience, pillars, products and competitors, kept separate so nothing bleeds across clients."],
    ['Content at agency volume', '1,200 credits a month shared across your brands — roughly 1,000 posts, or fewer posts plus AI images and ad creatives.'],
    ['Approval inbox', 'Every post with its image, reasoning and fact check in one queue. Approve, edit or reject in one place.'],
    ['Team seats', 'Up to 10 team members, so writers, designers and account managers work in the same place.'],
    ['Reports with your branding', 'Weekly and monthly reports per client as a PDF under your own name and logo, plus per-post performance you can export to CSV.'],
    ['Client-ready documents', 'Strategy decks, launch plans, competitor counter-angles and case study drafts generated from each Brand Brain.'],
  ]}
  week={[
    ['Monday', "AdMobot plans each client's week from its own strategy. Your team gets three separate queues to review."],
    ['Tuesday', 'Writers polish the drafts, designers swap images where needed, and approved posts are scheduled.'],
    ['Thursday', 'A client asks for a last-minute sale post. You type it to the AI CMO; the fact check confirms the offer is in their notes.'],
    ['Month end', 'Each client’s monthly report is ready as a PDF with your branding.'],
  ]}
  faq={[
    { q: 'How many brands can I manage?', a: 'Pro / Agency includes 3 brands, each with its own Brand Brain, strategy, approvals and publishing.' },
    { q: 'Can clients approve posts themselves?', a: 'Yes. Send each client an approval link: they see the pending posts and approve them or ask for changes, with no account needed. You can also add them as team members.' },
    { q: 'Is there white-labelling?', a: 'Yes, on Pro / Agency. The client approval page and report PDFs carry your agency name, logo and colours, and can run on your own domain.' },
    { q: 'Do credits carry across brands?', a: 'Yes. Your 900 monthly credits are shared by every brand on the account.' },
  ]}
  related={[
    ['Pricing and credits', '/pricing'],
    ['AI CMO vs agency vs freelancer', '/blog/ai-cmo-vs-agency-vs-freelancer'],
  ]}
/>
